    "description": "Wahl Signature\nGold Filled Ring Top Fountain Pen\nEarly 20th Century\nThis vintage Wahl Signature fountain pen features a gold-filled case with a classic chased geometric pattern. Produced during the golden age of American writing instruments, this \"ring top\" model was designed for portability, intended to be worn on a watch chain or chatelaine. The nib is clearly marked \"Wahl Signature Pen 14K,\" identifying the high-quality gold content characteristic of these premium writing tools. The barrel is personalized with the engraved name \"E. BURKLE.\"\nWahl Signature 14K gold nib (tested and marked)\nVintage gold filled case with decorative chased design\nRing top attachment for chain or lanyard use\nLever-filler mechanism for ink loading\nApproximately 3.75 inches in length\nCondition:\nVintage condition with visible signs of age and use. The gold-filled surface shows a natural aged patina and minor surface scratches; no significant dents or plating loss observed on the exterior. The personalized engraving \"E. BURKLE\" is deep and legible. The internal section shows significant ink residue and oxidation at the threads and section joint. The nib shows surface wear and staining but remains structurally intact. The filling mechanism has not been restored; functionality of the internal ink sac is unknown and should be assumed to require service for writing use.\nWarehouse Location: Canton\nDue to our lighting, white glare lines may appear on items - This is NOT damage\nIf you have any questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item or general questions regarding and item, please click Contact Seller on the item page and send us a message. We are available to answer your questions Monday through Friday, 8 am - 3:00 pm, EST.\n* For combined shipping policy see the shipping tab.\nSome items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nSee Photos. Items sold as-is.",
